        187.77,
        517.65,
        239.13,
        76.16,
        239.13
      ],
      "text": "It has been observed that the designated Link Officers have been delaying the\ndisposal of e-files pertaining to other Departments, thereby causing constraints in\nthe smooth functioning of day-to-day official work, including matters of utmost\nurgency."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 4,
      "poly": [
        74.97,
        256.81,
        517.65,
        256.81,
        517.65,
        296.38,
        74.97,
        296.38
      ],
      "text": "The Competent Authority has viewed the matter seriously and has directed\nthat all e-files received by the designated Link Officers shall be attended to and\ndisposed of immediately, without any delay."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        70.8,
        311.54,
        517.65,
        311.54,
        517.65,
        348.59,
        70.8,
        348.59
      ],
      "text": "Further, officers who are on duty-cum-tour to the mainland/inter-Islands shall\ncontinue to perform their routine duties and ensure timely disposal of e-files through\ne-Office."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        104.72,
        367.11,
        368.31,
        367.11,
        368.31,
        381.43,
        104.72,
        381.43
      ],
      "text": "The above instructions shall be adhered to strictly."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        102.93,
        394.9,
        404.6,
        394.9,
        404.6,
        408.37,
        102.93,
        408.37
      ],
      "text": "This issues with the approval of the Competent Authority."
    },
